@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Salud del proceso
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Salud de la base
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "negocio@credicuenta.test",
  "password": "DemoSegura#2026"
}

### REST Client reutiliza automaticamente el token y los IDs de las respuestas.
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@storeId = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Perfil y roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### @name products
### Productos de la tienda ficticia
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

@productId = {{products.response.body.$[0].id}}

### @name accounts
### Cuentas de la tienda ficticia
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores/{{storeId}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

@accountId = {{accounts.response.body.$[0].id}}

### @name purchase
### Registrar una compra de demostracion
POST {{baseUrl}}/stores/{{storeId}}/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-purchase-{{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "purchasedAt": "2026-10-20T10:00:00-05:00",
  "currency": "PEN",
  "mode": "END_OF_MONTH",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": "1" }
  ]
}

### @name cut
### Crear el corte asignado a la compra
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/cuts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-cut-{{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeId": "{{storeId}}",
  "cutAt": "{{purchase.response.body.$.assignedCutAt}}"
}

### @name paymentQuote
### Consultar el importe completo exigible para la fecha del pago
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/payment-quote?storeId={{storeId}}&paidAt={{purchase.response.body.$.obligations[0].dueDate}}T12:00:00-05:00
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### @name payment
### Pagar exactamente el importe oficial cotizado
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-payment-{{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeId": "{{storeId}}",
  "paidAt": "{{purchase.response.body.$.obligations[0].dueDate}}T12:00:00-05:00",
  "currency": "PEN",
  "amount": "{{paymentQuote.response.body.$.amount}}"
}

### Ver el comprobante del pago
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{payment.response.body.$.id}}/receipt?storeId={{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ver el cronograma de la cuenta
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/schedule?storeId={{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ver los estados de cuenta
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/statements?storeId={{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### @name clientLogin
### Entrar como el cliente ficticio
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "cliente@credicuenta.test",
  "password": "DemoSegura#2026"
}

### Consultar las cuentas desde el portal del cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{clientLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Consultar las compras desde el portal del cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{clientLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
